stateDiagram-v2
  classDef bad fill:#f96,stroke:#c00,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
  [*] --> Waiting
  Waiting : Waiting for input
  Waiting --> Checking: input
  Checking : Validating the request
  Checking --> Rejected: invalid
  Checking --> Accepted: valid
  class Rejected bad
  note left of Rejected
    Shown to the user,
    with the reason
  end note
  Rejected --> Waiting: retry
  Accepted --> [*]
